Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.75,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}喂 Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:03.18,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.90,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}能借你笔记本用一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:05.65,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}为啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:07.03,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}玩 Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:08.69,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我笔记本上没装 Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:09.87,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我可以装啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.88,0:00:10.81,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}听我说 Len
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:13.64,rin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,778)}{\b1}我不放心让你在我笔记本上装东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:14.69,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:16.23,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我才不要你那些乱七八糟的-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.46,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}求你了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:19.71,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:21.98,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}但你要是敢给我笔记本装病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:23.90,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我就让 Luka 揍你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.85,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你不会真这么干吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.26,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你等着瞧……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:30.07,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}好吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:31.94,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}来装 Minecraft 咯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:35.75,len,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,772)}{\b1}100%免费，没病毒，无需注册…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.93,0:00:38.36,Default - 复制,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(420,430)\frz11}{\fscx50\fscy50\t(0,100,\fscx100\fscy100)}喂，你的电脑中病毒啦!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.00,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}卧槽！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:42.13,len,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,762)}{\b1}我不小心给 Rin 的笔记本装了病毒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:43.69,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}要是被 Rin 发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:45.11,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Luka 会揍死我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.40,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}怎么办……？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:48.73,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}哦有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.45,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我去趟维修中心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.44,绿,,0,0,0,,{\b1}欢迎光临维修中心！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:55.65,绿,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我叫 Macne Nana
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:57.10,绿,,0,0,0,,{\b1}有什么可以帮你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:57.93,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:00.51,len,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,768)}{\b1}我不小心给 Rin 的笔记本装了病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:02.12,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}但我不知道怎么修
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.22,0:01:04.66,绿,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,755)}{\b1}Rin 的笔记本没装杀毒软件吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:05.53,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:07.75,len,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,762)}{\b1}她觉得那玩意占空间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:08.69,绿,,0,0,0,,{\b1}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:10.28,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}那你能修好这笔记本吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:10.91,绿,,0,0,0,,{\b1}当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.39,绿,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,752)}{\b1}不过修好大概需要几天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.12,绿,,0,0,0,,{\b1}费用大概三四十块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:17.64,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}钱我带了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:18.20,绿,,0,0,0,,{\b1}谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:21.40,绿,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,755)}{\b1}笔记本大概后天能修好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.41,0:01:22.31,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:24.84,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Len
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.84,0:01:25.84,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我笔记本呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.13,0:01:26.58,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:28.00,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你要笔记本干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:29.68,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我里面有重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:31.48,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}什么重要的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:33.07,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}别问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:34.13,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}哦呃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:34.64,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:35.60,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:36.52,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我不知道……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:39.81,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}好吧 Rin，我说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.82,0:01:43.90,len,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,778)}{\b1}我装免费 Minecraft 的时候不小心装了病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.91,0:01:46.18,len,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,745)}{\b1}然后拿去维修中心修了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.24,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}不过得等几天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:49.65,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你认真的……？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:50.54,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}嗯……对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:51.69,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Len
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.30,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我明天有考试
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.61,rin,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,759)}{\b1}没笔记本我怎么复习？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.01,0:01:57.57,len,,0,0,0,,{\b1}我不知道……看书？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:01:59.33,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}LUKAAAAAAAA！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.47,luka,,0,0,0,,{\b1}干嘛 Rin？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:01.83,luka,,0,0,0,,{\b1}没看我正忙着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:03.98,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Len 在我笔记本上装了病毒！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:05.25,luka,,0,0,0,,{\b1}说实话……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:06.45,luka,,0,0,0,,{\b1}你有点活该
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:07.02,rin,,0,0,0,,{\b1}等等什-
